   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Restoration and authenticity",
     "texto": [
      "**Pemugaran** is the restoration of a historic building; **memugar** names the action. To explain the process, distinguish what is preserved from what is modified.",
      "Passive forms such as **dicatat** put the focus on the information recorded, not on who records it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The meng-..-kan pattern",
     "texto": [
      "In «mengabadikan keadaan» and «menghubungkan masa lalu dan masa kini», the active verb ends in **-kan** and takes an object. The specific sense depends on each verb.",
      "**-Kan** has no single translation: the BIPA 4 textbook also presents benefactive, causative and transfer uses."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
